    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43830" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐεπι-χείρητος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>easy to be
				attacked</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				5.3.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				1.172
			</span></i>. Adv. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τως</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hierocl.
				<u>in CA</u>
				10p.436M.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>easy to be attempted</i> or <i>proven</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρόβλημα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>APr.</u>
					42b29
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Top.</u>
				111a11
			</span></i> (
				Comp.
			). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>insidious</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.107
			</span></i> (
				Comp.
			). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>readily attempting</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.L.
				4.30
			</span></i>.</div>
